    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/1/71132.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "Hello, everybody. I'm Kate Morton, a reporter with wispolitics.com here today with an episode of Wispolitics Capital Chats brought to you by Spectrum. Today, I'm with my colleague, Adam Kellnhoffer, who recently interviewed US Representative Gwen Moore, a Democrat from Milwaukee. So, Adam, what did you guys talk about?",
