        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s personal experience in Milwaukee represents broader systemic trends.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Cultural assimilation into dominant linguistic norms was necessary for socioeconomic integration.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Public transit systems are essential infrastructure for equitable workforce participation.",
