        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Affordable housing policies are feasible and effective if implemented properly.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The long-term stability of Black communities depends on sustained access to equitable housing opportunities.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Income parity alone would lead to meaningful improvements in housing equity without additional structural changes.",
        "confidence": 0.87
