    "turn_text": "i mean and i think that's a really fair question because you know i i don't think he joined politics just because I was in it. As a matter of fact, I even think he sort of resisted it, you know, the idea he's not going to do what his old lady did. But I think that he found himself in those phases. He was a community organizer. He cared about the bottom line. He is one of the few people, and I've mentored a lot of people, black, white, gay, straight, Native American, Hispanic, male, female, LGBTQ, and he is one of the few people And he's not the only one, but he's one of a few people that it really cares about this mission and it's not in it just for his own ego gratification. So I don't know, he didn't get into it because of me and he's really happy being part of the loyal opposition up there in Madison and we'll see.",
