    "turn_idx": 23,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, so I want to I want to touch on that Ways and Means Committee. Committee membership again. So raising the debt ceiling has been a contentious issue for as long as I can remember. We're having that fight right now, essentially. How bad is that fight to raise the debt ceiling going to get, do you think?",
